OL,3,GNEWSAKiller's string of driving
OL,4,Aoffences before dragging cyclist to
OL,5,Adeath
OL,6,
OL,7,FRichardson was sentenced to life in
OL,8,Fprison for murder and ordered to serve
OL,9,Fa minimum of 25 years at Manchester's
OL,10,FMinshull Street Crown Court on Monday.
OL,12,FBut this was not the first time he had
OL,13,Fcommitted a driving offence with Judge
OL,14,FMrs Justice Brunner saying he had an
OL,15,F"appalling" record including dangerous
OL,16,Fdriving the day after the murder.
